1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Welcome to the Wearelegend invoice tutorial.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
In this video, we will create, share, pay, and verify an invoice.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
First, connect an authorized admin wallet in the Create Invoice page.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Enter the USDT amount and set expiry date and time.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Token amount is auto-calculated from the live buy price.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Click Generate Invoice to create it on-chain.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Copy the invoice payment link and send it to the buyer.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The buyer opens the link and reviews invoice details.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Connect wallet on Ethereum Mainnet and check balances.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
You need enough USDT and a small ETH balance for gas.

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Payment uses two steps: Approve USDT, then Pay Now.

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Wait for blockchain confirmation.

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Once successful, you will see the transaction hash.

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Return to Invoice Management and click Resync All.

15
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Admin can verify paid status, payer wallet, and payment time.

16
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,000
That is the complete Wearelegend invoice workflow.

17
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Create, share, pay, and verify with confidence.
